+# KouriChat Next Headless 安装清单
+
+适用对象：`apps/desktop/release-headless/` 下的安装包（NSIS 安装版 / portable 便携版）。
+「headless」指**不携带 Python 运行时的桌面变体**，不是无界面程序——它照常打开 Electron 窗口，
+只是把运行时交给本机的 Hermes 源码树。
+
+## 0. 它如何找到运行时
+
+启动时按顺序解析：
+
+1. `HERMES_DESKTOP_HERMES_ROOT` 环境变量
+2. 构建时烘焙的 `localRuntimeRoot`（本包为 `D:\VSCodeProjects\hermes-agent`）
+3. `HERMES_DESKTOP_HERMES` 环境变量
+4. `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\hermes-agent`
+5. 已发布的 launcher
+6. 报错退出
+
+解释器只认该源码树自己的 `.venv`：`<root>\.venv\Scripts\python.exe`，其次
+`<root>\venv\Scripts\python.exe`；也可用 `HERMES_DESKTOP_PYTHON` 指定。**不回退 PATH 上的
+Python，也不会自动进入 bootstrap 安装。**
+
+实现见 [source-python.ts](apps/desktop/electron/source-python.ts) 与
+[headless-runtime.ts](apps/desktop/electron/headless-runtime.ts)。
+
+## 1. 必需项（缺一项后端起不来）
+
+- [ ] **Hermes 源码树**位于烘焙路径，且包含 `hermes_cli\main.py`
+  - 换路径时设 `HERMES_DESKTOP_HERMES_ROOT`，不要只移动安装包
+- [ ] **Python 3.11–3.14 的 venv**（`pyproject.toml`：`>=3.11,<3.15`）
+- [ ] **Python 依赖已装齐**
+- [ ] **模型凭据**：在 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\.env` 配置 API Key 或 OAuth，不要写进仓库
+- [ ] **Electron 运行时**：随安装包自带，无需另装
+
+在源码树内执行：
+
+```bat
+cd /d D:\VSCodeProjects\hermes-agent
+uv sync --all-extras --no-extra kittentts
+```
+
+若没有 `.venv`，先建一个真实的 CPython 环境（不要用 Microsoft Store 的 python stub）：
+
+```bat
+uv venv .venv --python 3.14
+uv sync --all-extras --no-extra kittentts
+```
+
+`kittentts` 是显式 opt-in，不装不影响其他能力；需要时单独 `uv sync --extra kittentts`。
+
+核心必需模块：`openai`、`rich`、`python-dotenv`、`ruamel.yaml`、`httpx`。缺失时
+`hermes doctor` 会报 Required Packages 失败。
+
+## 2. 基础宿主工具（建议全装）
+
+headless 不密封这些工具；缺失只让对应能力不可用，聊天、终端、文件、任务列表、定时任务、
+子代理仍可用。
+
+| 工具 | 用途 | 检查 |
+|---|---|---|
+| `git`（含 Git for Windows Bash） | 工作区、git 工具 | `git --version` |
+| `ripgrep`（`rg`） | 代码搜索；缺失时降级 grep | `rg --version` |
+| `uv` | PM 安装、修复、锁依赖 | `uv --version` |
+| `node` + `npm` | npx 型 MCP、部分技能与工具 | `node -v` / `npm -v` |
+| `ffmpeg` | 音视频处理与转码 | `ffmpeg -version` |
+| `gh` | GitHub 操作 | `gh --version` |
+
+```bat
+.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m hermes_cli.main pm install git ripgrep node npm ffmpeg gh uv
+```
+
+PM 下载源多为 GitHub release；网络不通时改用系统包管理器或官方安装包。
+
+## 3. 按能力选装
+
+| 能力 | 需要的包 | 说明 |
+|---|---|---|
+| 浏览器工具 | `chromium` | 约 170 MB；也可在 `config.yaml` 设 `browser.executable_path` 指向已有 Chromium |
+| Bitwarden Secrets | `bws` | 仅使用 Bitwarden 密钥注入时 |
+| 桌面操作（computer-use） | `cua-driver` | 仅使用桌面控制时 |
+| 本地语音转写 | `whispercpp-cpu` | 仅使用本地 STT 时 |
+| 本地模型推理 | `llamacpp-cpu` 或 GPU 变体 | NVIDIA → `llamacpp-cuda`；AMD → `llamacpp-vulkan` / `llamacpp-hip`；纯 CPU → `llamacpp-cpu`。只装一个 |
+
+```bat
+.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m hermes_cli.main pm install chromium
+.venv\Scripts\python.exe -m hermes_cli.main pm install bws cua-driver whispercpp-cpu llamacpp-cpu
+```
+
+云端模型、消息平台、语音、文档解析等 Python extras 由 `uv sync --all-extras` 覆盖；平台账号
+凭据仍在 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\.env`。
+
+## 4. 安装后自检
+
+- [ ] 版本可执行：
+
+  ```bat
+  .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m hermes_cli.main --version
+  ```
+
+- [ ] 诊断全绿（无 FAIL）：
+
+  ```bat
+  .venv\Scripts\python.exe -m hermes_cli.main doctor
+  ```
+
+  重点看 Required Packages、External Tools、Tool Availability 三节。
+
+- [ ] 启动 `KouriChat Next Headless.exe`（改名前构建的包为 `Hermes Headless.exe`）后，
+  `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\logs\desktop.log` 出现：
+
+  ```
+  [backend] using Hermes source at D:\VSCodeProjects\hermes-agent
+  [gateway-route win=main] published connection=local
+  ```
+
+- [ ] 设置 → About → Runtime 显示 `external/source`，而不是 bootstrap。
+
+headless 使用独立的产品身份与 userData（appId `com.nousresearch.hermes-headless`），可与正式版
+并存，不会覆盖正式版的会话与配置。
+
+## 5. 换机与离线
+
+- [ ] 源码树放在同一路径，**或**设 `HERMES_DESKTOP_HERMES_ROOT` 指向实际位置
+- [ ] venv 不在默认位置时，设 `HERMES_DESKTOP_PYTHON` 指向该解释器
+- [ ] 目标解释器必须已装完整依赖；headless 不会替你补
+- [ ] `pm install` 失败且网络不可用时，从同平台、同架构的机器复制
+  `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\tools\` 后再试
+
+## 6. 与 bundled 完整版的区别
+
+bundled 版把 Python、Node、Chromium 等受管工具密封进安装包，因此体积大、开箱即用；当前该变体
+仍因缺少 11 个受管包而受阻（`bws`、`chromium`、`cua-driver`、`gh`、`git`、`llamacpp-cpu/cuda/hip/vulkan`、
+`npm`、`python`）。headless 版反过来：包小，但要求目标机器的源码树与宿主工具齐备。
+
+## 7. 常见故障
+
+| 现象 | 原因 | 处理 |
+|---|---|---|
+| 启动提示找不到 Hermes 运行时 | 烘焙路径不存在，或没有可用 venv | 设 `HERMES_DESKTOP_HERMES_ROOT` / `HERMES_DESKTOP_PYTHON`，或重建 `.venv` |
+| `ModuleNotFoundError` | 依赖未装齐或装到了别的解释器 | 在目标 venv 内重跑 `uv sync --all-extras --no-extra kittentts` |
+| 浏览器工具报 Chromium 缺失 | 未装 PM Chromium，也未配置路径 | `pm install chromium` 或设 `browser.executable_path` |
+| `pm install` 卡住 / 下载失败 | GitHub release 不可达 | 放通网络，或离线复制 `%LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes\tools\` |
+| 用 Store 版 Python 建 venv 失败 | Microsoft Store 的 python 是重定向 stub | 安装真实 CPython 3.11–3.14，再 `uv venv` |
+
+## 8. 参考环境（2026-11-06 验证）
+
+| 项 | 版本 |
+|---|---|
+| Python（`.venv`） | 3.14.2 |
+| uv | 0.13.7 |
+| git | 2.56.0 |
+| ripgrep | 15.0.0 |
+| node / npm | 26.13.0 / 11.21.0 |
+| ffmpeg | 8.0.1 |
+| gh | 2.102.0 |
+
+构建与打包流程见 [BUILDING.md](apps/desktop/BUILDING.md)，headless 变体的实现与实测记录见
+[evidence/t15-headless.md](evidence/t15-headless.md)。
diff --git a/scripts/download-managed-tools.ps1 b/scripts/download-managed-tools.ps1
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000..99c80bdb34
--- /dev/null
+++ b/scripts/download-managed-tools.ps1
@@ -0,0 +1,188 @@
+#Requires -Version 5.1
+<#
+.SYNOPSIS
+    Download every managed tool package the Windows x64 desktop payload needs.
+
+.DESCRIPTION
+    Resumes into a build-owned store; re-running verifies existing entries and
+    skips them. The default store is outside user state, so this script does not
+    touch %LOCALAPPDATA%\hermes application data.
+
+    Package selection comes from pm/lock.json for the current target. Packages
+    that declare the target unsupported (for example iron-proxy on Windows) are
+    skipped automatically.
+
+.PARAMETER Store
+    Destination tool store. Default: <repo>\.cache\desktop-inputs\tools
+
+.PARAMETER StageToPayload
+    After a complete download, copy the verified tools into
+    apps\desktop\build\agent-payload\tools so `npm run payload` can reuse them
+    without downloading the tool layer again.
+
+.PARAMETER ListOnly
+    Print the resolved package set and exit without downloading.
+
+.PARAMETER Retries
+    Number of full passes after the first one when network failures occur.
+    Default: 3.
+
+.EXAMPLE
+    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\download-managed-tools.ps1 -ListOnly
+
+.EXAMPLE
+    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\download-managed-tools.ps1
+
+.EXAMPLE
+    powershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File .\scripts\download-managed-tools.ps1 -StageToPayload
+#>
+[CmdletBinding()]
+param(
+    [string]$Store = "",
+    [string]$Python = "",
+    [switch]$StageToPayload,
+    [switch]$ListOnly,
+    [int]$Retries = 3
+)
+
+Set-StrictMode -Version Latest
+$ErrorActionPreference = "Stop"
+
+$repo = Split-Path -Parent $PSScriptRoot
+if (-not $Store) {
+    $Store = Join-Path $repo ".cache\desktop-inputs\tools"
+}
+$Store = [System.IO.Path]::GetFullPath($Store)
+$payloadStore = [System.IO.Path]::GetFullPath((Join-Path $repo "apps\desktop\build\agent-payload\tools"))
+$logDir = Split-Path -Parent $Store
+$log = Join-Path $logDir "download-managed.log"
+New-Item -ItemType Directory -Force -Path $logDir | Out-Null
+
+if (-not $Python) {
+    $candidates = @(
+        (Join-Path $repo ".venv\Scripts\python.exe"),
+        (Join-Path $repo "venv\Scripts\python.exe")
+    )
+    $Python = $candidates | Where-Object { Test-Path -LiteralPath $_ } | Select-Object -First 1
+}
+if (-not $Python -or -not (Test-Path -LiteralPath $Python)) {
+    throw "No Python interpreter found. Create .venv first (uv sync --all-extras --no-extra kittentts) or pass -Python <path>."
+}
+$Python = (Resolve-Path -LiteralPath $Python).Path
+
+$env:PYTHONUTF8 = "1"
+$env:PYTHONIOENCODING = "utf-8"
+
+$worker = @'
+import sys
+from pathlib import Path
+
+from pm import prepare_tools, stage_tools
+from pm.install import _lockfile
+from pm.lock import Facts
+from pm.registry import get_package
+from pm.store import Store, current_target
+
+mode = sys.argv[1]
+store = Path(sys.argv[2]).resolve()
+payload = Path(sys.argv[3]).resolve()
+stage = sys.argv[4] == "1"
+target = current_target()
+lock = _lockfile()
+
+names = [name for name in lock.names() if not get_package(name).internal or name == "uv"]
+if "python" not in names:
+    names.append("python")
+names = [name for name in names if get_package(name).missing_reason(target) is None]
+
+print(f"target={target} packages={len(names)} store={store}", flush=True)
+for name in names:
+    print(f"  - {name} {lock.version(name)}", flush=True)
+if mode == "list":
+    raise SystemExit(0)
+
+store.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)
+store_handle = Store(store)
+failures = []
+for index, name in enumerate(names, 1):
+    print(f"[{index}/{len(names)}] {name} {lock.version(name)}", flush=True)
+    try:
+        prepare_tools([name], out=store, target=target)
+    except Exception as exc:
+        failures.append((name, str(exc)))
+        print(f"  FAIL {name}: {exc}", flush=True)
+        continue
+    fact = Facts(store / "facts.json").get(name)
+    entry = fact.get("entry") if fact else None
+    if not entry:
+        print(f"  WARN {name}: facts entry is missing", flush=True)
+        failures.append((name, "facts entry is missing"))
+        continue
+    root = store_handle.entry(entry)
+    size = sum(path.stat().st_size for path in root.rglob("*") if path.is_file())
+    print(f"  OK {entry} ({size / (1024 * 1024):.1f} MiB)", flush=True)
+
+if failures:
+    print(f"FAILED {len(failures)} package(s):", flush=True)
+    for name, reason in failures:
+        print(f"  - {name}: {reason}", flush=True)
+    raise SystemExit(1)
+
+print(f"DONE {len(names)} package(s) verified in {store}", flush=True)
+if stage:
+    print(f"staging verified tools into {payload}", flush=True)
+    stage_tools(names, source_store=store, out=payload, target=target)
+    print(f"STAGED {payload}", flush=True)
+else:
+    print("Next: re-run with -StageToPayload to populate apps\\desktop\\build\\agent-payload\\tools.", flush=True)
+'@
+
+Write-Host "Repository : $repo"
+Write-Host "Interpreter: $Python"
+Write-Host "Store      : $Store"
+Write-Host "Log        : $log"
+Write-Host ""
+
+Push-Location -LiteralPath $repo
+try {
+    $mode = if ($ListOnly) { "list" } else { "download" }
+    $stageFlag = if ($StageToPayload -and -not $ListOnly) { "1" } else { "0" }
+    $attempts = [Math]::Max(1, $Retries)
+    $exit = 1
+    for ($attempt = 1; $attempt -le $attempts; $attempt++) {
+        if (-not $ListOnly) {
+            Write-Host "=== pass $attempt / $attempts ==="
+        }
+        $previous = $ErrorActionPreference
+        $ErrorActionPreference = "Continue"
+        try {
+            $worker | & $Python -u - $mode $Store $payloadStore $stageFlag 2>&1 |
+                Tee-Object -FilePath $log -Append
+            $exit = $LASTEXITCODE
+        }
+        finally {
+            $ErrorActionPreference = $previous
+        }
+        if ($exit -eq 0) { break }
+        if ($attempt -lt $attempts) {
+            $delay = [Math]::Min(30, 5 * $attempt)
+            Write-Host "Retrying in $delay seconds (exit $exit)..."
+            Start-Sleep -Seconds $delay
+        }
+    }
+    if ($exit -ne 0) {
+        throw "Managed tool download failed after $attempts pass(es). See $log"
+    }
+}
+finally {
+    Pop-Location
+}
+
+if (-not $ListOnly) {
+    Write-Host ""
+    Write-Host "Managed tools are ready."
+    if (-not $StageToPayload) {
+        Write-Host "For an offline `npm run payload`, re-run with -StageToPayload."
+    }
+    Write-Host "Python wheels still come from PyPI during the payload venv step unless the uv cache is warm."
+}

